o be assessed by the student health examination board alongside Serizawa Aya. There he would meet Yanase Momoe and Shimizu Yuki. On the examination day, he would see the girls in their most embarrassing moments."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16157"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c16158","characterName":"芹沢 綾","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c16158"},"originalCharacterName":"芹沢 綾","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A heroine of this story. She is the vice president of the class that Tada Hitoshi is in. She has also served in the student council before. She has known Tada for a long time and usually argues with him. Serizawa is quite athletic and is the ace of the women's basketball club. Her body is quite well developed"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16158"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa0f46c6c1402580d5bc7eecbd05d0f63b111709753516c6371ed7bd02050188.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/7883aa445de8f2c376ba3c444f1df86511c7e76a4f55f9df28b0d2761547044b.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桃華 れん","creatorId":"vndb:s2692","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2692","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2692","name":"桃華 れん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54122","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c16736","characterName":"柳瀬 百恵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c16736"},"originalCharacterName":"柳瀬 百恵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A heroine. She attends a private girl's school (the same as Shimizu's) and carries a lady - like aura. Yanase had done ballet for a long time, and won many awards. She is quite proud of her flexible body thanks to ballet. She is now in the rhythmic gymnastic club. A very kind girl, with gentle and mild personality. Very considerate. Yanase is so polite, she even says thanks to the examiner (who looked at her naked and made her do embarrassing things)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16736"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5fedcc7b30e411540c1d2f2a25bcadc95840443ec84f53b5188d2dbe02b21e12.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3cc8794cae4d5e698bb59b74b08e8062443f14884aa4e63186681f34b362ab7.webp","width":109,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天川 みるく","creatorId":"vndb:s573","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s573","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s573","name":"天川 みるく","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54121","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c16737","characterName":"清水 由紀","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c16737"},"originalCharacterName":"清水 由紀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A heroine. She attends the same private girl's school as Yanase. She is in the swimming club, and holds the records in the 100m and 200m backstroke. Furthermore, Shimizu studies well and had won book contest before. As she has never have a chance to talk to boys, she is a bit shy. She is also rather quiet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Being a regular swimmer, she has visible tanlines under her clothes. This, coupled with her shyness, made the naked examination in front of many people a nightmare for her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16737"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc5f7bd067cb824cc1438e6ce49694d416a7aa02f04d56248ef78a3d1db32219.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43880d3ae72b331088aa3e3261bc6ace51380459c8daa5419ca04c54a2eb5180.webp","width":101,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"涼貴 涼","creatorId":"vndb:s519","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s519","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s519","name":"涼貴 涼","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54120","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:3094","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:3094","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:3094","name":"4H","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-brand:18958:3094","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2734","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2734","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2734","name":"4H","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:32185:v12913","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2734","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2734","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2734","name":"4H","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:32186:v12913","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
